  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed residential units, by reason of its location within a predominantly commercial area, would have a serious and adverse effect on the amenities enjoyed by future residents, by reason of excessive noise from nearby commercial uses and roads therefore would not be permitted as would not comply with the conditions MA.2. (2)(d) Part 3, Schedule 2 of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended).",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed change of use, because of the nature and scale of the use in this location, would not contribute to the distinctive commercial character of this conservation area and would undermine the function and attractiveness contrary MA.2. (2)(e) Part 3, Schedule 2 of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended)."
